---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../../../components/CodeBlock.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Couleurs & Patrimoine Chromatique"
  description="Les palettes et tokens de couleur du DSML — harmonie institutionnelle et richesse culturelle malienne (Indigo, Bogolan, Bazin, Wax, Fleuve Niger)."
  pageTitle="Couleurs & Identité Chromatique"
  pageSubtitle="Le DSML allie la réassurance du Vert d'État à la richesse culturelle du Mali (Indigo, Bogolan, Bazin, Wax et Fleuve Niger) pour créer des interfaces administratives modernes et inspirantes."
>

  <div class="color-hero-card">
    <div class="color-hero-flag-strip"></div>
    <div class="color-hero-content">
      <div class="color-hero-badge">Identité Visuelle & Modernité</div>
      <h2 class="color-hero-title">Une palette institutionnelle ancrée dans l'excellence et la culture</h2>
      <p class="color-hero-desc">
        Chaque nuance du DSML a été spécialement étudiée pour garantir une clarté administrative exemplaire (normes WCAG 2.1 AA/AAA) tout en permettant une expression visuelle riche et vivante aux services et événements publics du Mali.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="theme-studio-section">
    <div class="studio-header">
      <div>
        <span class="studio-tag">Démonstrateur Interactif</span>
        <h2 class="ml-title-2" style="margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;">Studio de thèmes d'accentuation</h2>
        <p class="ml-body-compact" style="color: var(--ml-color-neutral-600); margin-bottom:0;">
          Testez l'impact des différentes palettes culturelles du Mali sur un composant réel en basculant le thème d'accent ci-dessous :
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="theme-buttons-bar">
      <button class="theme-btn active" data-set-theme="state">
        <span class="theme-dot" style="background:#0B7A2F;"></span>
        Vert d'État (Institutionnel)
      </button>
      <button class="theme-btn" data-set-theme="indigo">
        <span class="theme-dot" style="background:#1D4ED8;"></span>
        Indigo de Ségou
      </button>
      <button class="theme-btn" data-set-theme="bogolan">
        <span class="theme-dot" style="background:#C25E25;"></span>
        Bogolan Sahélien
      </button>
      <button class="theme-btn" data-set-theme="bazin">
        <span class="theme-dot" style="background:#7E22CE;"></span>
        Bazin Royal
      </button>
      <button class="theme-btn" data-set-theme="river">
        <span class="theme-dot" style="background:#1B7A94;"></span>
        Fleuve Niger
      </button>
      <button class="theme-btn" data-set-theme="wax">
        <span class="theme-dot" style="background:#F59E0B;"></span>
        Wax Ambre
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="studio-preview-box" id="themePreviewBox" data-theme="state">
      <div class="demo-card">
        <div class="demo-card-header">
          <div class="demo-badge">Portail Administré</div>
          <h3 class="demo-card-title">Demande de Titre Foncier & Cartographie</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="demo-card-body">
          <p class="demo-text">
            Suivez l'avancement de votre dossier en temps réel. Les notifications automatiques vous alertent à chaque étape de validation.
          </p>
          
          <div class="demo-form-group">
            <label class="demo-label">Référence du Dossier</label>
            <input type="text" class="demo-input" value="ML-2026-BKO-8842" readonly />
          </div>

          <div class="demo-actions">
            <button class="demo-btn-primary">
              <i class="ml-icon-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Valider mon Dossier
            </button>
            <button class="demo-btn-secondary">
              <i class="ml-icon-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> Télécharger le PDF
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="demo-callout">
            <i class="ml-icon-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <div>
              <strong>Note de service :</strong> Les pièces justificatives scannées sont transmises directement aux agents de vérification.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="copyToast" class="copy-toast" aria-live="polite">Code copié dans le presse-papier !</div>

  <div class="palette-section">
    <div class="palette-section-header">
      <h2 class="ml-title-2">01. Trio National (Vert, Or & Rouge)</h2>
      <p class="ml-body-compact" style="color: var(--ml-color-neutral-600);">
        Les trois couleurs de la Nation malienne formellement déclinées en échelles complètes pour l'ergonomie applicative.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h3 class="palette-subtitle">Mali Green — Vert d'État (Accent principal & Navigation)</h3>
    <div class="palette-grid">
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-green-50">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-green-50);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Green 50</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-green-50</div><div class="swatch-hex">#EAF3EC</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-green-100">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-green-100);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Green 100</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-green-100</div><div class="swatch-hex">#D8EBDC</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-green-200">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-green-200);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Green 200</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-green-200</div><div class="swatch-hex">#9CC7A8</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-green-400">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-green-400);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Green 400</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-green-400</div><div class="swatch-hex">#0F8A3A</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-green-500">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-green-500);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-green-600); font-weight:800;">Green 500 ★</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-green-500</div><div class="swatch-hex">#0B7A2F</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-green-700">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-green-700);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Green 700</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-green-700</div><div class="swatch-hex">#085020</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-green-900">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-green-900);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Green 900</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-green-900</div><div class="swatch-hex">#0A3D1C</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-green-mint">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-green-mint);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-green-mint); font-weight:700;">Mint Accent</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-green-mint</div><div class="swatch-hex">#10B981</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="palette-subtitle" style="margin-top:24px;">Mali Gold — Or de Kéniéba & Bambouk (Mises en valeur & Badges)</h3>
    <div class="palette-grid">
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-gold-50">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-gold-50);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Gold 50</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-gold-50</div><div class="swatch-hex">#FBF6E7</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-gold-200">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-gold-200);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Gold 200</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-gold-200</div><div class="swatch-hex">#F3DC8C</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-gold-400">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-gold-400);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:#8A6600; font-weight:800;">Gold 400 ★</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-gold-400</div><div class="swatch-hex">#F5C518</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-gold-600">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-gold-600);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Gold 600</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-gold-600</div><div class="swatch-hex">#B98900</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-gold-800">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-gold-800);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Gold 800</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-gold-800</div><div class="swatch-hex">#8A6600</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-gold-amber">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-gold-amber);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-gold-amber); font-weight:700;">Amber Sunshine</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-gold-amber</div><div class="swatch-hex">#F59E0B</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="palette-subtitle" style="margin-top:24px;">Mali Red — Rouge National (Alertes & Erreurs)</h3>
    <div class="palette-grid">
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-red-50">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-red-50);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Red 50</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-red-50</div><div class="swatch-hex">#FBEBEC</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-red-200">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-red-200);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Red 200</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-red-200</div><div class="swatch-hex">#E8B4B8</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-red-500">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-red-500);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-red-500); font-weight:800;">Red 500 ★</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-red-500</div><div class="swatch-hex">#CE2029</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-red-700">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-red-700);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Red 700</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-red-700</div><div class="swatch-hex">#991B1B</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-red-terracotta">
        <div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-red-terracotta);"></div>
        <div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Terracotta</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-red-terracotta</div><div class="swatch-hex">#E05A47</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="palette-section">
    <div class="palette-section-header">
      <h2 class="ml-title-2">02. Palettes Culturelles & Patrimoniales</h2>
      <p class="ml-body-compact" style="color: var(--ml-color-neutral-600);">
        Inspirées de l'art textile, de l'artisanat et des paysages géographiques emblématiques du Mali.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cultural-palette-card">
      <div class="cultural-header" style="border-left-color: var(--ml-color-indigo-segoo);">
        <div class="cultural-title">Indigo Malien — Tissus de Ségou & Djenné</div>
        <p class="cultural-desc">
          Symbole de noblesse et de savoir-faire ancestral de la teinture à l'indigo. Idéal pour les portails de savoir, d'éducation et de diplomatie.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="palette-grid">
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-indigo-50"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-indigo-50);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Indigo 50</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-indigo-50</div><div class="swatch-hex">#EEF2FF</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-indigo-200"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-indigo-200);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Indigo 200</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-indigo-200</div><div class="swatch-hex">#C7D2FE</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-indigo-segoo"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-indigo-segoo);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-indigo-segoo); font-weight:800;">Indigo Ségou</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-indigo-segoo</div><div class="swatch-hex">#1D4ED8</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-indigo-500"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-indigo-500);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Indigo 500</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-indigo-500</div><div class="swatch-hex">#3730A3</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-indigo-djenne"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-indigo-djenne);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Indigo Djenné</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-indigo-djenne</div><div class="swatch-hex">#1E3A8A</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-indigo-900"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-indigo-900);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Indigo Nuit</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-indigo-900</div><div class="swatch-hex">#120F36</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cultural-palette-card" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <div class="cultural-header" style="border-left-color: var(--ml-color-bogolan-argile);">
        <div class="cultural-title">Bogolan Sahélien — Terre, Suie & Kaolin</div>
        <p class="cultural-desc">
          Les teintes naturelles de l'étoffe de boue malienne (ocre, argile cuite, suie de bambou et kaolin). Parfait pour l'artisanat, le tourisme et l'environnement.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="palette-grid">
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-bogolan-kaolin"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-bogolan-kaolin); border-bottom:1px solid #E2D9C8;"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Kaolin Blanc</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-bogolan-kaolin</div><div class="swatch-hex">#FBF8F1</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-bogolan-ocre"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-bogolan-ocre);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Ocre Doré</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-bogolan-ocre</div><div class="swatch-hex">#D97706</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-bogolan-argile"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-bogolan-argile);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-bogolan-argile); font-weight:800;">Argile Terracotta</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-bogolan-argile</div><div class="swatch-hex">#C25E25</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-bogolan-terre"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-bogolan-terre);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Terre Cuite</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-bogolan-terre</div><div class="swatch-hex">#78350F</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-bogolan-suie"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-bogolan-suie);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Suie de Bambou</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-bogolan-suie</div><div class="swatch-hex">#292524</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cultural-palette-card" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <div class="cultural-header" style="border-left-color: var(--ml-color-bazin-violet-500);">
        <div class="cultural-title">Bazin Royal & Wax Éclatant — Élégance & Fêtes</div>
        <p class="cultural-desc">
          Les couleurs vibrantes et étincelantes des grands boubous en bazin riche et des imprimés wax (violet royal, bougainvillier magenta, ambre). Idéal pour les événements culturels et la création.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="palette-grid">
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-bazin-violet-50"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-bazin-violet-50);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Violet Soft</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-bazin-violet-50</div><div class="swatch-hex">#F3E8FF</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-bazin-violet-500"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-bazin-violet-500);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-bazin-violet-500); font-weight:800;">Violet Royal</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-bazin-violet-500</div><div class="swatch-hex">#7E22CE</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-bazin-magenta-500"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-bazin-magenta-500);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-bazin-magenta-500); font-weight:800;">Bougainvillier</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-bazin-magenta-500</div><div class="swatch-hex">#DB2777</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-bazin-turquoise-500"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-bazin-turquoise-500);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-bazin-turquoise-500); font-weight:700;">Turquoise Wax</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-bazin-turquoise-500</div><div class="swatch-hex">#06B6D4</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-wax-amber-500"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-wax-amber-500);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-wax-amber-500); font-weight:700;">Wax Ambre</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-wax-amber-500</div><div class="swatch-hex">#F59E0B</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cultural-palette-card" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <div class="cultural-header" style="border-left-color: var(--ml-color-gold-500);">
        <div class="cultural-title">Or du Sahel & Mandingue — Richesse Minérale & Soleil</div>
        <p class="cultural-desc">
          Les nuances d'or éclatant (Bouré, Keniéba), de soleil cuivré et d'orange mandingue. Symboles de prospérité économique, d'énergie et de rayonnement de l'Empire du Mali.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="palette-grid">
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-gold-50"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-gold-50); border-bottom:1px solid #F3DC8C;"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Or Clair</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-gold-50</div><div class="swatch-hex">#FBF6E7</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-gold-300"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-gold-300);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Sahel Jaune</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-gold-300</div><div class="swatch-hex">#FACC15</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-gold-500"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-gold-500);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:var(--ml-color-gold-900); font-weight:800;">Or de Bouré ★</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-gold-500</div><div class="swatch-hex">#EAB308</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-orange-mandingue"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:#EA580C;"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:#EA580C; font-weight:800;">Orange Mandingue</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-orange-mandingue</div><div class="swatch-hex">#EA580C</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-amber-sahel"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:#D97706;"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name" style="color:#D97706; font-weight:700;">Ambre Solaire</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-amber-sahel</div><div class="swatch-hex">#D97706</div></div></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" data-copy="--ml-color-gold-900"><div class="swatch-color" style="background:var(--ml-color-gold-900);"></div><div class="swatch-info"><div class="swatch-name">Or Profond</div><div class="swatch-var">--ml-color-gold-900</div><div class="swatch-hex">#785A00</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cultural-palette-card" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <div class="cultural-header" style="border-left-color: var(--ml-color-river-500);">
        <div class="cultural-title">Fleuve Niger — Eau, Vitalité & Connectivité</div>
        <p class="cultural-desc">
          Les nuances d'eau et de teal représentant l'artère nourricière du Mali. Recommandé pour les applications de transport, d'eau, d'infrastructures et d'énergie.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="palette-grid">
